    "detailed_description": "This chess-based game adds a layer of strategy and depth, while the meme-tastic visuals and over-the-top animations keep the tone light and playful.<br>Whether you're a left-wing or a right-wing memer, there's something in Culture Warz Chess to tickle your funny bone and maybe even make you think twice about the state of online discourse.<br>Local multiplayer allows players to battle it out in person.<br><br>Key Features;<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play 3d Chess with Zombies and Chads.<br></li><li>Change your camera perspective from top-down to 3d to view all angles of the board.<br></li><li>View close-ups of pieces getting taken with epic animations.<br></li><li>Play against 3 difficulties of AI<br></li><li>Play local Co-Op.</li></ul><br>But Culture Warz Chess isn't just about quirky pieces and witty banter. It's a thought-provoking and strategic experience that throws you into the heart of today's most polarizing debates.",
